{"verse_key": "72:6", "surah": 72, "verse": 6, "text_uthmani": "وَأَنَّهُۥ كَانَ رِجَالٌ مِّنَ ٱلْإِنسِ يَعُوذُونَ بِرِجَالٍ مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ فَزَادُوهُمْ رَهَقًا", "translation": "And there were men from mankind who sought refuge in men from the jinn, so they [only] increased them in burden [i.e., sin].", "verse_from_ms": 55810, "verse_to_ms": 68910, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/72.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَأَنَّهُۥ", "start_ms": 55810, "end_ms": 57780}, {"i": 1, "text": "كَانَ", "start_ms": 57780, "end_ms": 58410}, {"i": 2, "text": "رِجَالٌ", "start_ms": 58410, "end_ms": 59260}, {"i": 3, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 59260, "end_ms": 60270}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱلْإِنسِ", "start_ms": 60270, "end_ms": 61640}, {"i": 5, "text": "يَعُوذُونَ", "start_ms": 61640, "end_ms": 62780}, {"i": 6, "text": "بِرِجَالٍ", "start_ms": 62780, "end_ms": 63900}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 63900, "end_ms": 64650}, {"i": 8, "text": "ٱلْجِنِّ", "start_ms": 64650, "end_ms": 65970}, {"i": 9, "text": "فَزَادُوهُمْ", "start_ms": 65970, "end_ms": 67420}, {"i": 10, "text": "رَهَقًا", "start_ms": 67420, "end_ms": 68835}]}